000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RATHOM01.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE UNDERWRITING SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* RATHOM01  HOME BUILDINGS RATING
000600* CALLED BY PRMCALC (BATCH) AND PRMCALC0 (CICS) AS 'RATHOM01'.
000700* SETS RATE-BASE-PREMIUM FROM THE SUM-INSURED BAND, THEN ADDS
000800* LINE LOADINGS AND DISCOUNTS FROM THE 60-BYTE RISK DETAIL.
000900* BANDS AND RATES ARE THE SAME AS dw.ref_rate_band IN claimsdb.
001000*================================================================
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001300     COPY RDHOM.
001400 01  WS-BAND                     PIC X(02).
001500 01  WS-PCT                      PIC 9V9999.
001600 LINKAGE SECTION.
001700     COPY POLREC.
001800     COPY RATEREC.
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD.
002000 0000-MAIN.
002100     MOVE POL-RISK-DETAIL TO WS-HOM-DETAIL
002200     PERFORM 1000-BASE-RATE
002300     PERFORM 2000-LOADINGS
002400     MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RETURN-CODE
002500     GOBACK.
002600 1000-BASE-RATE.
002700     EVALUATE TRUE
002800         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 150000
002900             MOVE 'B1' TO WS-BAND
003000             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003100                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00273
003200         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 350000
003300             MOVE 'B2' TO WS-BAND
003400             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003500                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00213
003600         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 750000
003700             MOVE 'B3' TO WS-BAND
003800             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003900                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00213
004000         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 1500000
004100             MOVE 'B4' TO WS-BAND
004200             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004300                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00205
004400         WHEN OTHER
004500*            ABOVE THE TOP BAND: RATE AT THE TOP BAND, REFER
004600             MOVE 'XX' TO WS-BAND
004700             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004800                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00205
004900             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
005000     END-EVALUATE
005100     IF RATE-BASE-PREMIUM < 120.00
005200         MOVE 120.00 TO RATE-BASE-PREMIUM
005300     END-IF.
005400 2000-LOADINGS.
005500     IF WS-BUILD-YEAR < 1920 AND WS-BUILD-YEAR > ZERO
005600         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
005700             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
005800     END-IF
005900     IF WS-BEDROOMS > 5
006000         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
006100             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.075
006200     END-IF
006300     IF WS-FLOOD-ZONE > 2
006400         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
006500             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.150
006600     END-IF
006700     IF WS-FLOOD-ZONE > 6
006800         SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
006900     END-IF
007000     IF WS-SUBSIDENCE = 'Y'
007100         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007200             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.040
007300     END-IF
007400     EVALUATE WS-ROOF-TYPE
007500         WHEN 'T'
007600             CONTINUE
007700         WHEN 'S'
007800             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
007900                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.050
008000         WHEN 'F'
008100             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
008200                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.100
008300         WHEN OTHER
008400             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
008500     END-EVALUATE
008600     IF WS-LISTED = 'Y'
008700         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
008800             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
008900     END-IF.
